usage: analyze_results.py [-h] --seed0 SEED0 --seed1 SEED1 --seed2 SEED2
                          --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR

Validate and plot the three approved, unmodified DPPO HalfCheetah runs.
Accepts explicit native log directories or result.pkl paths. No training,
model loading, smoothing, interpolation, extrapolation, or artifact curation
occurs.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --seed0 SEED0         Seed 0 native log directory or result.pkl
  --seed1 SEED1         Seed 1 native log directory or result.pkl
  --seed2 SEED2         Seed 2 native log directory or result.pkl
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
                        New runs/<analysis-id>/candidates directory inside
                        this study
